TriboWorkFlow
=============

Conservative port of the TribChem workflows to Quantum ESPRESSO, MLIPs and
CP2K, without MongoDB, FireWorks and atomate.

Licence of this package: not decided yet.
The third-party code it contains stays under its own licence, listed below.
Every copied or adapted file states its source in its header. The "Use"
entries describe the planned reuse.


